# MAGIC %md ## 8.2 HbA1c Units
# MAGIC
# MAGIC We assume that recorded values < 15 are percentages rather than mmol/mol. We use the (inverse of the) IFCC-NGSP master equation to convert them:
# MAGIC
# MAGIC $$ \text{percentage} = 0.09148 \times \text{mmol/mol} + 2.152 $$
# MAGIC
# MAGIC We additionally require that the final HbA1c value be >= 15. 

# COMMAND ----------

def convert_hba1c_units(col):
    # Given a column of creatinine values in percentage, converts it to mmol/mol using the IFCC-NGSP equation
    return (col - 2.152) / 0.09148

